    "base": "https://store.nynjtc.org",
    "collection": "https://store.nynjtc.org/collections/maps",
    "read_date": "2026-09-17",
    "read_how": "The collection's public products.json, read through a browser-shaped fetch; a bare curl from the sandbox got the store's 'verifying your connection' page and HTTP 429, which is why no script reads the store on a schedule."
